 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Noah found favor in the eyes of the Lord",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A righteous man, blameless among the crowd",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He walked with God in the dark and the storm",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Shem and Ham and Japheth by his side stood",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The earth was filled with violence and sin",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God said the end of all flesh had come in",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Make yourself an ark of cypress wood",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Coat it with pitch, keep the family good",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Two of every living creature, male and female",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Birds of every kind, kept alive and stable",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Rain on the earth for forty days and nights",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Wiping out every living being from the sights",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Noah was six hundred years old that day",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Went into the ark to keep the family safe",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The springs of the deep burst open wide",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The floodgates of heaven opened their eyes",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The waters rose and lifted the ark high",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Drifting on the surface, under the sky",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Fifteen cubits above the mountains' peak",
